  "narrative": {
    "text": "**Business & market dynamics:** Rekor is benefiting from a clear operational inflection, with its AI-driven mobility platform gaining commercial traction. The business is shifting favorably toward higher-margin software and recurring revenue, and all major product lines contributed to growth in the latest quarter. Multi-year contract wins and a broad demand environment suggest the company is converting its technology into a scalable, repeatable model. While still early‑stage, the combination of growing recurring revenue and a leaner cost base points to improving business quality.\n\n**Management strategy and execution:** Leadership has executed a decisive cost‑reduction program, trimming headcount and streamlining operations to create a faster, more focused organization. Management described the current structure as “leaner, faster, and more focused” than a year ago, signaling a disciplined pivot from growth at any cost toward sustainable profitability. The credible progress toward positive EBITDA and the achievement of the company’s first cash‑generating quarter mark an important step in building market confidence that the turnaround strategy is taking hold.",
